Lance, great question! Here are the words for hex digits:

A  dau
B  fei
C  gai
D  jau
E  rei
F  vai

More vocabulary can be found on these wordlists:

http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=Lojban+Wordlists

-Eppcott

